## Safety
- Do not run `git reset --hard`, `git clean -fd`, or broad deletion commands unless the user explicitly asks.
- Do not delete `data/`, `storage/`, `omnivoice_env/`, or `node_modules/`.
- Do not print passwords, tokens, cookies, or other secrets.
- Summarize long logs. Keep user-facing output concise.
